  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Blue Mule** (2 other sources): The band also slipped a Happy Birthday tune into this song [1][2]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Thirst Multilator**: back after 183 archived shows (837 days); rare: 3 archived performances [3]\n- **Somehow Tonight**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 3 archived performances [3]\n- **No More To Leave You Behind**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 7 archived performances [3]\n- **Red Rockin Chair**: rare: 3 archived performances [3]\n- **A Love Of Mine**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **Blue Mule**: rare: 14 archived performances [3]\n- **Doin Things Right**: rare: 10 archived performances [3]\n- **My Walkin Shoes**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2019-10-30.bs2019-10-30flac24mg20** (recommended): source not stated; 23 songs; 132 min [1]\n- **billystrings2019-10-30.bs2019-10-30flac16mg20**: source not stated; 24 songs; 132 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- The show ended with an instrumental Happy Birthday played for Debra Apostal [1]\n- The show ended with an instrumental Happy Birthday played for Debra Apostal [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2019-10-30.bs2019-10-30flac24mg20**: taped by George Heston; transferred by George Heston; source: microtech gefell mg20(cards) > PFA > Nbox Platinum > Tascam HDP2 oade acm mod(24/48) [1]. Also: Recorded with SFTU mics left of center, clamped to the balcony about three feet from the rail; levels raised 5 dB for the acapella part [1]\n- **billystrings2019-10-30.bs2019-10-30flac16mg20**: taped by George Heston; transferred by George Heston; source: microtech geffel mg20(cards) > PFA > Nbox Platinum > Tascam HDP2 oade acm mod(24/48) [2]. Also: Recorded with SFTU mics left of center, clamped to the balcony about three feet from the rail; levels raised 5 dB for the acapella part [2]",
